<section class="page-body section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-content">
        <span class="page-kicker">// Bio</span>
        <div class="about-body page-copy">
          <p>
            I started DJing in May 2017 and played
            <a href="https://vimeo.com/463652373" rel="noopener">themed Tea Time tunes</a>
            at <span class="hl-pink">Twitter HQ</span>. I usually DJed with
            <a href="https://soundcloud.com/juliengaillard" rel="noopener">Julien Gaillard</a>
            on the
            <a href="https://vimeo.com/463687716" rel="noopener">guitar</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            In the summer of 2019, I was the tour DJ for
            <a href="https://soundcloud.com/ohsimsimah" rel="noopener">Sim Simah</a>
            and
            <a href="https://music.apple.com/us/artist/aarxn-cxle/1453179768" rel="noopener">Aarxn Cxle</a>.
            The picture is by
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/meria.agency/" rel="noopener">Jesse Meria</a>
            from July 2019 at
            <a href="https://www.thenewparish.com/" rel="noopener">The New Parish</a>,
            where we were
            <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20191023073406/https://www.teamllfent.com/news/2019/7/30/camron-with-special-guest-troyllf" rel="noopener"><span class="hl">the opening act</span></a>.
          </p>
        </div>

